{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After... is a story-driven survival horror game with stealth elements, set in a post-apocalyptic world devastated by an unknown epidemic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cities are silent now except for the sound of the infected wandering the empty streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to explore what\u2019s left, gather supplies, and find a way to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no fights against  hordes here... every infected you encounter means certain death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence, patience, and quick thinking are your only weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only person you can rely on is yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make could lead to your salvation... or your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Adapt. Endure in a world that has already ended.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"There is a way out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094260/a68b9577dd6e39970ab0c911719b29c76f129347.jpg"},{"name":"Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094260/9351d1d39f98236a820053f091214e5032988e71.jpg"},{"name":"Back to school","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094260/37718b37d6840a261829501eeccb7ca04876a57d.jpg"},{"name":"Easy walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094260/082eafc4c66b5014c44a96b170d077cf44882022.jpg"},{"name":"Light at the end of the tunnel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094260/aaa50d0ea8fae929619c1d45b3af294cc7cacb8a.jpg"},{"name":"Home sweet home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094260/a8fe77ec3e3e4192c5afa67a326358b1e1a681a7.jpg"},{"name":"My Precious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094260/c